===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰewbʰ-}}
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:dep|tree=++}}
From {{inh|en|enm|dep}}, {{m|enm|deep}}, {{m|enm|depe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dēop|t=deep, profound; awful, mysterious; heinous; serious, solemn, earnest; extreme, great}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*deup}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*deupaz|t=deep}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰewbʰ-|t=deep}}.

{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|depe|t=deep}}, {{cog|frr|diip}}, {{m|frr|jip|t=deep}}, {{cog|stq|djoop|t=deep}}, {{cog|fy|djip|t=deep}}, {{cog|nl|diep|t=deep}}, {{cog|nds|deep|t=deep}}, {{cog|lb|déif|t=deep}}, {{cog|gmw-cfr|deep}}, {{m|gmw-cfr|deef|t=deep}}, {{cog|de|tief|t=deep}}, {{cog|gsw|tüüf|t=deep}}, {{cog|mhn|tiaf|t=deep}}, {{cog|wym|tif}}, {{m|wym|tīf}}, {{m|wym|tiif|t=deep}}, {{cog|yi|טיף|t=deep}}, {{cog|da|dyb|t=deep}}, {{cog|nn,sv|djup|t=deep}}, {{cog|gmq-scy|djyber|t=deep}}, {{cog|nb|djup}}, {{m|nb|dyp|t=deep}}, {{cog|fo,is|djúpur|t=deep}}, {{cog|got|𐌳𐌹𐌿𐍀𐍃|t=deep}}, {{cog|lt|dubùs|t=deep, hollow}}, {{cog|sq|det|t=sea}}, {{cog|cy|dwfn|t=deep}}.
