===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|broadly}} A collection of (usually) organized [[information]] in a regular structure, usually but not necessarily in a [[machine-readable]] format accessible by a [[computer]].
#: {{ux|en|I have a '''database''' of all my contacts in my personal organizer.}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} A set of [[table]]s and other objects (queries, reports, forms) in the form of a structured data set.
#: {{ux|en|The "books" '''database''' will have three tables, and the "customers" '''database''' will have two tables.}}
# {{lb|en|computing|loosely|metonymically}} A software program (application) for storing, retrieving and manipulating such a structured data set.
#: {{ux|en|Which '''database''' do you use: MySQL or Oracle?}}
# {{lb|en|computing|loosely|metonymically}} A combination of such data sets and the programs for using them.

