##* {{RQ:Shakespeare Henry 6-2|act=IV|scene=iv|page=140|column=1|passage=The Rebels are in Southvvarke: Fly my Lord: / ''[[w:Jack Cade's Rebellion|Iacke Cade]]'' proclaimes himſelfe Lord ''Mortimer'', / '''Deſcended''' from the Duke of ''Clarence'' houſe, / And calles your Grace Vſurper, openly, / And vovves to Crovvne himſelfe in VVeſtminſter.}}
##* {{RQ:Shakespeare As You Like It|act=I|scene=ii|page=188|column=1|passage=Thou ſhould'ſt haue better pleas'd me vvith this deede, / Hadſt thou '''deſcended''' from another houſe: {{...}}}}
##* {{RQ:Estienne Liebault Maison Rustique|edition=new|chapter=[Of Hunting or Chasing of the Stag.] What Dogs are Best for the Course or Hunting.|page=674|passage=[I]f a dog be not vvel '''deſcended''', that is to ſay, begot by an excellent dog, or an excellent bitch, there can be little hope of his goodneſſe.}}
##* {{RQ:Spectator|author=Steele|issue=78|date=30 May 1711|page=469|passage=''The humble petition of'' WHO ''and'' WHICH, {{...}} We are '''descended''' of ancient families, and kept up our dignity and honour many years till the jack-sprat THAT supplanted us.}}
##* {{RQ:Gibbon Roman Empire|volume=IV|chapter=[[w:Zeno (emperor)|Zeno]] and [[w:Anastasius I Dicorus|Anastasius]], Emperors of the East{{nb...}}|page=4|passage=An hero, '''deſcended''' from a race of Kings, muſt have deſpiſed the baſe Iſaurian vvho vvas inveſted vvith the Roman purple, vvithout any endovvments of mind or body, vvithout any advantages of royal birth, or ſuperior qualifications.}}
##* {{RQ:Twain Warner Gilded Age|chapter=XXI|page=196|passage=They came over to Massachusetts Bay in another vessel, and thus escaped the onus of that brevet nobility under which the successors of the Mayflower Pilgrims had '''descended'''.}}
##* {{RQ:Maugham Razor's Edge|section=v|page=140|passage=Didn't you know? I am '''descended''' in the female line from the Court de Lauria who came over to England in the suite of [[w:Philip II of Spain|Philip the Second]] and married a maid of honour of Queen [[w:Mary I of England|Mary]].}}
