# {{lb|en|transitive|ergative}} To prepare and arrange (originally military unit or units, i.e., to array troops) for use.
#: {{syn|en|field}}
#: {{ux|en|"'''Deploy''' two units of infantry along the enemy's flank," the general ordered.}}
