#: {{ux|en|Teachers can '''deploy''' a wide range of resources in their classrooms.}}
#* {{RQ:Landon Francesca Carrara|page=293|volume=I|text=The carriage, which was at full gallop, stopped suddenly; the guards '''deployed''' round, and Mademoiselle alighted. She advanced with the step of an empress, till she came beside the Queen, when, dropping on her knee, she kissed the hem of her robe, and then the royal hand.}}
